Subject: [PATCH 1/2] arm: add experimental MT6762 early-boot research machine

AI-assisted local experiment; not intended for upstream submission. Model the dump-derived CPU topology, RAM, UART subset, GICv3 and timers. Preserve explicit unsupported peripheral boundaries.
